SUMMARY:Film Screening - You Can't Go Home Again from CBS (1979)
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special screening of “You Can’t Go Home Again” from CBS\, a rare chance to experience Thomas Wolfe’s work on screen. \n\n\n\nThis adaptation of the classic novel stars Chris Sarandon and Lee Grant and follows the story of a young writer trying to make it in New York\, his relationships\, and the editor who sees his potential for literary genius. Come join us\, grab some popcorn\, and enjoy the nostalgia of this 1979 television movie. \n\n\n\nThis is a FREE EVENT. Please reserve your seat here: https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/film-screening-you-cant-go-home-again-from-cbs–1979 \n\n\n\nDonations are happily accepted and go toward the Memorial’s programming and other special events like this.
URL:https://wolfememorial.com/event/film-screening-you-cant-go-home-again-from-cbs-1979/
LOCATION:The Thomas Wolfe Memorial\, 52 North Market Street\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://wolfememorial.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CBS-LHA-promo.png
END:VEVENT
