SUMMARY:From Death to Mourning: Spiritual Journeys of the Wolfe Family
DESCRIPTION:Join us for this intimate\, open-house style tour of the Old Kentucky Home as we explore how the Wolfe Family grappled with death\, spiritualism\, and mysteries of the beyond. Discover stories of early 20th century funerary practices\, family visions\, and the ways death shaped one of America’s greatest writers.  \n\n\n\nCome and see the skeletons in our closets. \n\n\n\n$10 per person – purchase tickets HERE.
URL:https://wolfememorial.com/event/from-death-to-mourning-spiritual-journeys-of-the-wolfe-family-2/
LOCATION:The Thomas Wolfe Memorial\, 52 North Market Street\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://wolfememorial.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2026-From-Death-To-Mourning-Instagram-Post.png
END:VEVENT
